PSL Piast: [+ psl_piast_votes_disp +]%

PSChD: [+ pschd_votes_disp +]%

ZLN: [+ zln_votes_disp +]%

Blok Mniejszości Narodowych: [+ minorities_bloc_votes_disp +]%

Inne: [+ other_votes_disp +]%

Highest voting intention: [+ simulation_largest_party +]. This preview does not allocate seats or change a sitting parliament.

